            <ArticleTitle>A randomised crossover trial of facemask efficacy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>72-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The efficacy of different facemasks that can be used in the delivery of aerosol medication to children with recurrent wheeze or asthma was investigated. The results showed a statistically significant difference between some of the masks used, which has important implications for current clinical practice</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
